      "canonical_latex": "p_{pb} = p_c + \\Delta p_{\\mathrm{inj}} + \\Delta p_t,\\quad \\Delta p_{p} = p_{pb} + \\Delta p_{\\mathrm{feed}} - p_{\\mathrm{tank}}",
